libxmp-lite 4.5.0, PS2 port
================================

Source:
  https://github.com/tatokis/libxmp-lite-ps2

Imported revision:
  99ff14c973326b11d0d50701daee58fad2e6ebb3

Only the public header and the library source needed by the in-tree build
are vendored here. The original PS2 Makefile compiles these sources with
LIBXMP_CORE_PLAYER enabled; SNESticle Revive does the same from its main
Makefile. The menu scanner currently exposes only MOD and XM files even
though this libxmp-lite source also contains S3M and IT loaders.

See LICENSE for the MIT license.
